<title>USA: South Africa sells $500 mln 20-yr debt, yld +183bp.</title>
<headline>South Africa sells $500 mln 20-yr debt, yld +183bp.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>the Republic of South Africa was priced on Wednesday,</p>
<p>according to lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER REPUBLIC OF SOUTH AFRICA</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	 COUPON 8.50 PCT   MATURITY 6/23/2017</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.43   FIRST PAY DATE 12/23/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 8.56 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P BB-PLUS	  SPREAD 183 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672</p>
